Data notices
------------
data/processed/ contains unmodified excerpts of the U.S. Centers for Medicare
& Medicaid Services (CMS) National Coverage Determinations Manual, and
data/ontology/ contains ICD-10-CM code titles (CMS / CDC NCHS). These are
U.S. government works in the public domain and are not covered by the
copyright above. See data/README.md for sources and retrieval details.

All clinical case narratives, test scenarios and ground-truth labels in this
repository are synthetic and project-authored. They contain no real patient
data and must not be used for clinical or payment decisions.
